WEBVTT

NOTE
Approving a reply, BistroTech help. Captions written by record_valasz.mjs,
timed to the recorded taps. v0.1.0, 2026-09-25.

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.901 line:2% size:92% align:center
Open the Válaszok (Replies) tab.

2
00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:05.230 line:2% size:92% align:center
Next to the tab you can see
how many replies are waiting.

3
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:09.254 line:2% size:92% align:center
The worst review comes first.
Read it. Below is the ready reply.

4
00:00:09.254 --> 00:00:11.737 line:2% size:92% align:center
Edit it if you need to.

5
00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:15.237 line:2% size:92% align:center
With the Átírás (Rewrite) buttons
you can ask for it shorter,
warmer or firmer,

6
00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:17.439 line:2% size:92% align:center
or switch it to formal
or informal address.

7
00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:19.889 line:2% size:92% align:center
You can restore the original
at any time.

8
00:00:19.889 --> 00:00:21.833 line:2% size:92% align:center
Press Jóváhagyás (Approve).

9
00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:24.683 line:2% size:92% align:center
You can undo it
for eight seconds.

10
00:00:24.683 --> 00:00:29.198 line:2% size:92% align:center
If you have added us as a manager
on Google, we post the reply
within a few minutes.

11
00:00:29.198 --> 00:00:32.900 line:2% size:92% align:center
If not, copy it with one button
and paste it on Google.

12
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.714 line:2% size:92% align:center
Faster with a keyboard:
A approves, S skips,
J and K move, E edits,

13
00:00:36.714 --> 00:00:39.114 line:2% size:92% align:center
O opens Google,
U undoes.
